}}
The '''Barrel Vault''' (also known as the '''Double Leg Reverse Vault''') is a [[vault]] used in [[freerunning]] where the practitioner performs a [[reverse vault]] while keeping both legs together for style.

{{Infobox technique
|image = 
|discipline = [[Freerunning]]
|difficulty = Advanced
}}
The '''Cast Bomb''' is a [[vault]] used in [[freerunning]] in which a practicioner performs a [[reverse kong vault]] directly into a [[castaway]] [[back flip]].

